@host = http://localhost:8080
@customerEmail = customer1@marketplace.test
@contractorEmail = contractor1@marketplace.test
@password = Demo!12345

### Request a CSRF cookie and token before unsafe calls.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/csrf

### Login (your HTTP client must send the XSRF cookie value in X-XSRF-TOKEN).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

{"email":"{{customerEmail}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Search customers
GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers?lastName=sm&limit=20

### Browse open jobs
GET {{host}}/api/v1/jobs?status=Open&limit=20
